{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"malet_backstory","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_malet_cellar.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"While they waited for Malet's contact to prepare the route documents, the broker poured something amber into two cups.","text_ko":"말렛의 연락책이 경로 문서를 준비하는 동안, 중개인은 호박색 액체를 두 잔에 따랐다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_amused"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"You're wondering about the eyes.","text_ko":"눈이 궁금하신 거죠."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Memory Ampoules. High grade.","text_ko":"기억 앰풀. 고등급이군."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"Seventeen different people's memories, layered over what's left of my own. I see through borrowed eyes. Literally.","text_ko":"열일곱 사람의 기억이, 제게 남은 것 위에 겹겹이 쌓여 있습니다. 저는 빌린 눈으로 봅니다. 말 그대로요."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_deal_accepted"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"I was Authority once. Did you know that? Bureau of Memory Regulation, Division 3. I classified burns. Decided which memories were acceptable losses.","text_ko":"저도 한때 관리국이었습니다. 아셨나요? 기억규제국 제3과. 연소를 분류했죠. 어떤 기억이 허용 가능한 손실인지 결정하는 일이었습니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"What happened?","text_ko":"무슨 일이 있었지?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"I found a memory they didn't want classified. Grade 1. Institutional. The kind that, if people remembered it, would unmake the Bureau from the inside out.","text_ko":"그들이 기밀로 남기고 싶어 하지 않는 기억을 발견했습니다. 1등급. 기관급. 사람들이 기억해 낸다면, 관리국을 안에서부터 해체할 종류의."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_amused"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"So they burned ME. Everything I was. Twenty-three years of service, gone in four seconds.","text_ko":"그래서 그들은 '저'를 태웠습니다. 제 전부를요. 이십삼 년의 복무가, 사 초 만에 사라졌죠."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_deal_accepted"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"I rebuilt myself from other people's fragments. Seventeen donors. Some willing, most not.","text_ko":"저는 타인의 파편으로 저 자신을 다시 지었습니다. 기증자 열일곱. 자발적인 이도 있었고, 대부분은 아니었지만."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"He drained his cup in one motion.","text_ko":"그는 단번에 컵을 비웠다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/10","jump":null,"original_index":10,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_amused"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":10,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":10,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"So when I ask for your memory of a sword, understand that I know exactly what I'm taking. And I don't feel guilty about it.","text_ko":"그러니 제가 당신의 검의 기억을 요구할 때, 무엇을 가져가는지 정확히 알고 요구한다는 걸 이해해 주십시오. 그리고 저는, 그것에 죄책감이 없습니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_backstory/11","jump":null,"original_index":11,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_malet_seventeen_eyes.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":8,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":11,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":11,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"His amber eyes caught the lamplight. Seventeen people's stolen light, looking out through one man's face.","text_ko":"그의 호박색 눈이 등불을 받아냈다. 열일곱 사람에게서 훔친 빛이, 한 남자의 얼굴을 통해 바깥을 내다보고 있었다."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"203ac1190088d2850e4effe75fe212b21e071e1b8509462471c6ba56fe557416","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
